{"articleNo":"159508","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=159508&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016-2학기 9월분 국가근로장학금 지급 지연 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.10.10","hit":"3619","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국가근로장학생 여러분 안녕하십니까</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2016-2</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월분 국가근로장학금이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 지급예정이었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지급 당일 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국장학재단의 내부사정상 재원 미교부</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 인해 불가피하게&nbsp;이번주 중으로(빠르면 10월 11일)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;지급예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학생 여러분께 일일이 양해를 구하지 못한 점 송구하게 생각하며 우리 학생처에서는 이번 재원 미교부건에 대해 한국장학재단에 다시는 이런 발생하지 않도록 이의제기를 엄중히 하였고 향후 이런일이 발생하지 않도록 거듭 약속을 받았습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">앞으로도 장학생 여러분이 피해를 보지 않도록 최선을 다하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">거듭 죄송하다는 말씀을 드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학생 여러분의 넓은 협조와 양해를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">□ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">문의처</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 2.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국장학재단 예산담당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">053)238-2473</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - &nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생처 학생과 근로장학담당 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font